@host = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar
GET {{host}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token (401)
GET {{host}}/vehiculos

### Obtener uno
GET {{host}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{host}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Sprinter",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2022,
  "capacidad_carga": 1500
}

### Crear con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{host}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "",
  "anio": 1800,
  "capacidad_carga": -5
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Sprinter 515",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2023,
  "capacidad_carga": 1800
}

### No existe (404)
GET {{host}}/vehiculos/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{host}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
